## Frontend configuration (Vite)
#
# Default behavior (when unset): API calls go to the same origin and Vite's
# dev server proxy forwards `/api` to the backend (see `vite.config.js`).
#
# Set this only if you are NOT using the Vite proxy or you deploy the API
# on a different host.
#
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
